{"channelId":"UCwzqfge4CdTw5TIvNJ9DOcA","row":["Mama's Cradle Animal Sanctuary - Carina Suarez",3240,"WE ARE A HOME FOR THE ABUSED, ABANDONED, AND NEGLECTED DOGS AND CATS. WE ARE ALSO A HOME FOR WORLD CLASS POMERANIANS THAT MADE A MARK IN THE PHILIPPINES. \n\nThis page is dedicated to Mama's Cradle, our sanctuary by the lake, and our rescued dogs and cats we rescue, treat, medicate, rehabilitate, rehome and foster.\nWe are a small group who rescue severe and critical cases of animal abuse, cruelty and neglect.\nI am also a dog show exhibitor of pomeranians, successful in producing local Philippine born poms winning Best in Shows, Hall of Famers, Grand Champions, Champions and Award of Merit poms.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwzqfge4CdTw5TIvNJ9DOcA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwzqfge4CdTw5TIvNJ9DOcA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:54.327Z","channelId":"UCwzqfge4CdTw5TIvNJ9DOcA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"8d19db28cf18feaca63df3d24c3b4c99834a627b90091f2bdf1d44c27e057c24","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"28e900ff61b76aea484c53825ec691ee62bb066cf9b2adc9cce5ea0fca74f12e"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwzqfge4CdTw5TIvNJ9DOcA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":3240,"raw":"3.24K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwzqfge4CdTw5TIvNJ9DOcA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:54.327Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"name_only","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"organization_self_report","excerpt":"r sanctuary by the lake, and our rescued dogs and cats we rescue, treat, medicate, rehabili